# oc-sim scenario v1
# Open the app menu by holding up and down together and move the highlight
# down one entry, then stop with the menu still up: the golden snapshot is
# the list itself, entries right of the empty scroll track the screens that
# scroll line up with, the highlight clear of it.
ticks 200
20  button up down
60  button down down
70  button up up
70  button down up
90  button down down
100 button down up
